<section id="intro" class="content">
  <img src="/images/profile-small.jpg" alt="Kyle Jackson" class="pic" width="1000" height="1500" data-reveal>
  <h1 id="intro-heading" class="content-heading" data-reveal>Hi, I’m Kyle Jackson.</h1>
  <p class="background-paragraph" data-reveal>I graduated from the University of North Texas with a <span class="accent-pink"><em>Bachelor of Arts</em></span> in <span class="accent-blue">Radio, Television, and Film</span> (English Minor). I love movies, writing, and all things artistic, and web design has been a great outlet. I spent a lot of time making <em>fan-sites</em> and <em>digital art</em> as a hobby in high school, and returning to that passion as a career has been amazing!  I’m currently based in the Dallas/Fort-Worth area.</p>
  <p class="work-ethic-paragraph" data-reveal><strong>Front-End Development</strong> combines my love of <span class="accent-pink"><em>creative expression</em></span> with my penchant for <span class="accent-blue">puzzles and problem solving</span>.</p>
</section>

